  <article class="card section">
    <div class="section-title" data-i18n="home.why.title">Why this bot</div>
    <div class="home-hero__subtitle" style="margin:0 0 12px" data-i18n="home.why.subtitle">
      A bot can have 200 commands and still be useless. Wolium is built around “daily value”.
    </div>

    <div class="home-why">
      <div class="card card-hover">
        <h4 data-i18n="home.why.i1.title">Dashboard, not a spreadsheet</h4>
        <p data-i18n="home.why.i1.text">UI is part of the product: charts, profiles, tooltips, quick navigation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-hover">
        <h4 data-i18n="home.why.i2.title">Updates without pain</h4>
        <p data-i18n="home.why.i2.text">New features show up fast (often without a bot restart).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-hover">
        <h4 data-i18n="home.why.i3.title">Community-first</h4>
        <p data-i18n="home.why.i3.text">Ideas from users aren’t “noted”, they actually get implemented.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-hover">
        <h4 data-i18n="home.why.i4.title">Localization</h4>
        <p data-i18n="home.why.i4.text">Bot supports 25 languages. Site supports RU/EN/ES/UA (you can contribute!).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-hover">
        <h4 data-i18n="home.why.i5.title">Privacy by design</h4>
        <p data-i18n="home.why.i5.text">You decide what data is stored. You can delete it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-hover">
        <h4 data-i18n="home.why.i6.title">Made by one dev since 2021</h4>
        <p data-i18n="home.why.i6.text">No “corporate bot”. Just a long-running project that keeps improving.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

